00:00:04.099 --> 00:00:06.349
(laughing)

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:08.605
- Bit shady, isn't it?

00:00:08.605 --> 00:00:09.438
(laughing)

00:00:09.438 --> 00:00:10.874
- All right then.
- Drag meat.

00:00:10.874 --> 00:00:11.707
- Okay.

00:00:12.597 --> 00:00:14.214
- [Man] 11, take one.

00:00:14.214 --> 00:00:15.820
