of Eric, if I may say so,

00:09:36.830 --> 00:09:40.710
like it's definitely,
100% down to the writers

00:09:40.710 --> 00:09:42.120
that we've got and Laurie Nunn,

00:09:42.120 --> 00:09:47.120
